{"updated":"2026-09-02T02:25:31.580Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Australia news live: economy grows by 2.1% in year to June; Telstra outage driven by lack of oversight and expertise, investigation finds. Elsewhere, germany says Russia behind Leipzig airport drone attack. And relief as five Australians missing in Nepal-Tibet flood disaster found alive. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, under high tension, though Russia, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 1.9 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 0.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 2.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 56 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.6 near 159 km WSW of Abepura, Indonesia. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.27,0.31,0.35,0.38,0.42,0.46,0.49,0.52,0.56,0.58,0.63,0.74,0.84,0.99,1.23,1.35,1.39,1.42,1.44,1.49,1.51,1.53,1.56,1.6,1.64,1.71,1.76,1.81,1.85,1.88,1.92,1.96,1.99,2.04,2.09,2.13,2.16,2.21,2.24,2.29,2.33,2.38,2.44,2.5,2.55,2.67,2.76,2.88,2.9,2.95,2.98,3.03,3.08,3.15,3.26,3.34,3.4,3.47,3.51,3.56,3.61,3.65,3.69,3.71,3.75,3.79,3.81,3.83,3.85,3.9,3.95,4.03,4.09,4.14,4.23,4.3,4.41,4.46,4.5,4.53,4.6,4.71,4.87,5.02,5.46,5.55,5.61,5.64,5.7,5.77,5.84,5.91,5.97,6.04,6.13,6.19,6.26,6.34,6.38,6.47,6.53,6.7,6.76,6.91,6.94,7.06,7.17,7.23,7.29,7.35,7.41,7.46,7.51,7.57,7.62,7.69,7.73,7.79,7.85,7.91,7.96,8.03,8.13,8.3,8.63,8.87,9.15,9.27,9.3,9.35,9.44,9.5,9.57,9.61,9.65,9.71,9.74,9.78,9.87,9.93,10.04,10.12,10.28,10.31,10.55,10.63,10.73,10.79,10.86,10.91,10.99,11.08,11.15,11.23,11.29,11.36,11.47,11.52,11.63,11.67,11.74,11.78,11.83,11.89,11.95,11.97,12.03,12.07,12.16,12.25,12.31,12.38,12.42,12.46,12.52,12.54,12.57,12.65,12.78,12.83,12.88,12.92,12.99,13.11,13.14,13.18,13.21,13.26,13.28,13.3,13.34,